    "text": ":rotating_light: OLake Helm v0.0.22 Released:rotating_light:\n:link: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/releases/tag/olake-0.0.22\u003e\n:rocket: Features \u0026 Fixes in this release:\n• fix(helm): use `first` to guard empty imagePullSecrets list by \u003c@U08H6LN432P\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/167|#167\u003e\n\n:memo: Note: If you encountered the `slice index out of range` error during `helm upgrade --install olake` when no `imagePullSecrets` were configured, this issue has been fixed in v0.0.22. You can upgrade directly to v0.0.22.\n\n\n:rotating_light: OLake Helm v0.0.23 Released:rotating_light:\n:link: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/releases/tag/olake-0.0.23|github.com/datazip-inc/…/olake-0.0.23\u003e\n:rocket: Features \u0026 Fixes in this release:\n• Feat/global pod annotations by \u003c@U08H6LN432P\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/169|#169\u003e\n\n:rotating_light: OLake Helm v0.0.24 Released:rotating_light:\n:link: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/releases/tag/olake-0.0.24|github.com/datazip-inc/…/olake-0.0.24\u003e\n:rocket: Features \u0026 Fixes in this release:\n• feat: jobserviceaccount enable by default by \u003c@U08H6LN432P\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-helm/pull/173|#173\u003e\nThanks for the contribution!",
